{"id":"n71893-1-8","stage":5,"title":"의식주 · 衣食住","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71893-1-8-1","ko":"형부가 직장을 구했으니 다행이야.","zh":"姐夫找到了工作，真是太好了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"형부가","meaning":"姐夫","explanation":"형부：姐夫；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"형부","audio":"/audio/48328ba7d203f729286b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73222","senseId":"1","lemma":"형부","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"형부가","audio":"/audio/0c521ee499a1a60df6ac.mp3"}},{"text":"직장을","meaning":"职业，职场，工作","explanation":"직장：职业，职场，工作；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"직장","audio":"/audio/fdfb4ffae29b3defcce4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58297","senseId":"2","lemma":"직장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"직장을","audio":"/audio/b79a67e2f0defe312858.mp3"}},{"text":"구했으니","meaning":"找，弄，求","explanation":"구하다：找，弄，求；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；으니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"구하다","audio":"/audio/288eb4bbfc0c27cc5bf6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58299","senseId":"1","lemma":"구하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"구했으니","audio":"/audio/9a44bda2d8bcc8995b06.mp3"}},{"text":"다행이야.","meaning":"万幸，幸事，走运","explanation":"다행：万幸，幸事，走运；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"다행","audio":"/audio/c1308a8fe6495062fda3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28359","senseId":"1","lemma":"다행","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다행이야","audio":"/audio/db3ecff68a32494e3534.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"48328ba7d203f729","term":"형부","zh":"姐夫","audio":"/audio/48328ba7d203f729286b.mp3","entryId":"73222","definition":"女子用于指称或称呼姐姐的丈夫。","pronunciation":["형부"]},{"id":"fdfb4ffae29b3def","term":"직장","zh":"职业，职场，工作","audio":"/audio/fdfb4ffae29b3defcce4.mp3","entryId":"58297","definition":"指收取报酬而做的事。","pronunciation":["직짱"]},{"id":"288eb4bbfc0c27cc","term":"구하다","zh":"找，弄，求","audio":"/audio/288eb4bbfc0c27cc5bf6.mp3","entryId":"58299","definition":"为得到需要的东西而寻找；或指寻找以求得到。","pronunciation":["구하다"]},{"id":"c1308a8fe6495062","term":"다행","zh":"万幸，幸事，走运","audio":"/audio/c1308a8fe6495062fda3.mp3","entryId":"28359","definition":"意外地运气好。","pronunciation":["다행"]}],"audio":"/audio/e3e75729ba6017ddef00.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n71893-1-8-2","ko":"언니도 의식주 걱정은 이제 그만하고 편하게 살아.","zh":"姐姐也别再为吃穿住用发愁了，好好地过日子吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"언니도","meaning":"姐姐（女性对姐姐的称呼）","explanation":"언니：姐姐（女性对姐姐的称呼）；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"언니","audio":"/audio/9ab740751e1be982fcd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31971","senseId":"1","lemma":"언니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"언니도","audio":"/audio/81959557eda797d07390.mp3"}},{"text":"의식주","meaning":"衣食住，温饱","explanation":"의식주：衣食住，温饱。","readings":[{"term":"의식주","audio":"/audio/f174c3adb8bc5dde8c67.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71893","senseId":"1","lemma":"의식주","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"의식주","audio":"/audio/f174c3adb8bc5dde8c67.mp3"}},{"text":"걱정은","meaning":"担心，忧虑，担忧","explanation":"걱정：担心，忧虑，担忧；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"걱정","audio":"/audio/7582493f75565a84cbf1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17232","senseId":"1","lemma":"걱정","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"걱정은","audio":"/audio/16181ca032a1469ff8e2.mp3"}},{"text":"이제","meaning":"今后","explanation":"이제：今后。","readings":[{"term":"이제","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61172","senseId":"2","lemma":"이제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이제","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3"}},{"text":"그만하고","meaning":"停止，停","explanation":"그만하다：停止，停；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그만하다","audio":"/audio/129344a9c4625793da06.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37072","senseId":"1","lemma":"그만하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그만하고","audio":"/audio/a4ec1ecfa14dbb2aad18.mp3"}},{"text":"편하게","meaning":"舒服，舒畅","explanation":"편하다：舒服，舒畅；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"편하다","audio":"/audio/33bf1e37d2739b22abdd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71334","senseId":"1","lemma":"편하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"편하게","audio":"/audio/309170ec60471065c486.mp3"}},{"text":"살아.","meaning":"生活，过活，过日子","explanation":"살다：生活，过活，过日子；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"살다","audio":"/audio/12dad67abf287f9a30d4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69579","senseId":"2","lemma":"살다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"살아","audio":"/audio/30d811da4a1eb958a364.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"9ab740751e1be982","term":"언니","zh":"姐姐（女性对姐姐的称呼）","audio":"/audio/9ab740751e1be982fcd7.mp3","entryId":"31971","definition":"女子用于指称或称呼兄弟姐妹或亲戚兄弟姐妹中比自己年长的女性。","pronunciation":["언니"]},{"id":"f174c3adb8bc5dde","term":"의식주","zh":"衣食住，温饱","audio":"/audio/f174c3adb8bc5dde8c67.mp3","entryId":"71893","definition":"人类生活的基本要素，穿着、饮食和住宅。","pronunciation":["의식쭈"]},{"id":"7582493f75565a84","term":"걱정","zh":"担心，忧虑，担忧","audio":"/audio/7582493f75565a84cbf1.mp3","entryId":"17232","definition":"害怕发生不好的事情而感到不安。","pronunciation":["걱쩡"]},{"id":"16ebe2403bccd648","term":"이제","zh":"今后","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3","entryId":"61172","definition":"从今以后。","pronunciation":["이제"]},{"id":"129344a9c4625793","term":"그만하다","zh":"停止，停","audio":"/audio/129344a9c4625793da06.mp3","entryId":"37072","definition":"停住正在做的事。","pronunciation":["그만하다"]},{"id":"33bf1e37d2739b22","term":"편하다","zh":"舒服，舒畅","audio":"/audio/33bf1e37d2739b22abdd.mp3","entryId":"71334","definition":"身体或心情不难受，好。","pronunciation":["편하다"]},{"id":"12dad67abf287f9a","term":"살다","zh":"生活，过活，过日子","audio":"/audio/12dad67abf287f9a30d4.mp3","entryId":"69579","definition":"人过生活。","pronunciation":["살ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/7d886f38e94983b36264.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.33,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/Search